    LLM: 'Game: Badeucy. Type: Triple Draw Split-Pot Poker. Rules: Half pot for best 4-card Badugi; Half pot for best 5-card 2-to-7 Lowball. 3 draws. Aces High. Straights/Flushes count against low.',
    Player: "The blinds are posted. You've got five cards in front of you. Remember: Aces are the enemy here, and a straight will break your low. Look for mixed suits and low ranks from 2 to 7. Ready for your first draw?",
